Well, your pet, provided you still have one, which is generally a good 
idea, knows about cursed stuff. So, anything a pet will willing step on 
(not just reluctantly), without you displacing it onto it, or it being 
teleported onto it or there being some food on the same square or it 
falling down a trapdoor, following you down the stairs onto such a 
square, well you get the idea, will be non-cursed (i.e. uncursed or 
blessed). Other than that, just try doing Sokoban first, then head to 
Mine Town, or the other way round, depending on how well lit the mines 
are...

Holy Water can be either found, but that's not something I'd count on, 
can be made by a rather involved method through, IIRC , confused remove 
curse scrolls, or by the "standard" method, dropping potions of water 
onto a co-aligned altar and then, while standing on the altar, and not 
having prayed or received an artifact or having negative luck (I guess), 
#praying, will convert any non-holy water into holy water, holy water 
itself will just remain holy water.

